# ALLOW-LIST. Everything is ignored unless it is listed here. Only our own source and docs may be public.
# Never add the disc, anything the build makes (build/: extracted game files, generated C, Rugrats.exe),
# save states, memory cards, screenshots, audio/video clips, backups or the dev notes. See PUBLISHING.md.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/PUBLISHING.md
!/LICENSE
!/Launcher.bat
!/recomp/

# Inside recomp/: block caches and every non-source file type, even if someone drops one in by mistake.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.bin
*.cue
*.iso
*.img
*.chd
*.pbp
*.ecm
*.exe
*.dll
*.pdb
*.lib
*.obj
*.o
*.state
*.mcd
*.mcr
*.sav
*.raw
*.bmp
*.png
*.jpg
*.gif
*.wav
*.mp3
*.ogg
*.mp4
*.str
*.xa
*.tim
*.vab
*.vh
*.vb
*.zip
*.bps
*.ips
*.xdelta
*.tex
*.fnt
*.7z
*.rar
*.json
*.csv
*.log
*.ini
# Example mods are plain text we wrote (no game data): only their mod.ini.
!/recomp/mods/*/mod.ini
